{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11207180","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11207180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1120718001:0":{"text":"ふん、あなたたちサンドクローがしたことを知らないとでも思ってるの！？","source_cn":"哼，你们这群流沙之爪，以为大家不知道你们做过什么事吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63F2073E16969F21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120718002:0":{"text":"町の周囲で略奪や誘拐をして……どれだけの人を傷つけたことか！","source_cn":"镇子周围的劫掠和绑架……你们害了多少人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE22695A1761421E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120718003:0":{"text":"僕はしてないんだ……！","source_cn":"卢玛没做过那些事……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD7C389E87488FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120718004:0":{"text":"とぼけるな！お前たちが略奪をするようになってから、仕入れの商隊がさっぱり寄りつかなくなっちまったんだぞ！","source_cn":"少装无辜！自从你们开始劫掠，供货商队都不敢来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729DE9440EF76A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120718005:0":{"text":"僕はずっとキャンプで炊事をしてたので、わ……悪いことはしてません！","source_cn":"卢玛一直在营地里煮汤，没——没做过坏事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA554E95627A9DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120718006:0":{"text":"ボスがいなくなって、サンドクローも散り散りになりました……\n僕はただ、仕事を見つけて食いぶちを稼ぎたいだけなんです……助けてください……","source_cn":"头儿没了，流沙之爪也散了……\\n卢玛只是想找点活儿干，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x198AB95767752DBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120718007:0":{"text":"いいから出ていけ。出なければお前たちみたいな悪党は砂漠に捨てて、虫のエサにしてやる！","source_cn":"你走不走？像你们这种恶棍，就该丢到沙漠里暴晒，再喂给沙虫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C9B4E70E8D51FA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120718008:0":{"text":"そんな面倒なことをしなくていい。親族を誘拐された人たちがサンドクローの奴らに懸賞金をかけてるから、こいつをとっ捕まえて金にしようぜ！","source_cn":"用不着那么麻烦，有好些亲属被绑架的人悬赏流沙之爪的人头...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F5DB5EB54CEEA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120718009:0":{"text":"おい、逃げるなって。狙いを外したら死に際に苦しむことになるぞ……","source_cn":"别跑得太快，小家伙。要是枪瞄不准，你的生命会结束得很痛苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B46EBBB246A2D78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120718010:0":{"text":"い……嫌だ！助けて、助けてぇっ！","source_cn":"不——不要！救命、救命啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE852ED4FAA5EC1B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal